Not included, fetched at build time:

  antmicro/renode-verilator-integration
  (https://github.com/antmicro/renode-verilator-integration),
  commit c9692ca32c8c160e0c268bd0f5207359cee1626d, MIT licence.
  scripts/fetch_upstream.sh downloads it into output/. Only
  samples/apb3uart/Apb3UartCtrl.v (SpinalHDL output) is compiled.

  Renode's DPI IntegrationLibrary and the Verilator runtime come from the
  locked Renode and Verilator installations under their own licences.
